#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopAccountCustomizationMenuTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Account Customization<c/> lets you set account-wide cosmetics and profile flair.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Titles<c/>\n"
"Choose the title shown on your player card and chat.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Emotes<c/>\n"
"Equip emotes for quick expression.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Containers<c/>\n"
"Choose your bag cosmetics.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Graves<c/>\n"
"Set your gravestone appearance.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Shields<c/>\n"
"Configure your displayed shield cosmetics.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Tip:<c/> Open each category and confirm changes to apply."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopBagsPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Containers<c/> are account-wide cosmetics for your personal loot bags. Only you see your own.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Slots:<c/> Each kind of bag has a slot of its own. A pack has one container for each; mix packs and singles as you like.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Use:<c/> Pick a container to see it drop, and Equip puts it in its slot.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopBagsPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Bag Tier Slots<c/>"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopCharacterCustomizationMenuTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Character Customization<c/> lets you manage visuals and active pet setup.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Character Cosmetics<c/>\n"
"Equip skins, dyes, hats, particles, titles, and your displayed pet.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Pet<c/>\n"
"Choose your active pet and configure pet-token slots.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Tip:<c/> Use previews first, then click <c#9DFF8C>Confirm Changes<c/> to apply."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopCharacterCustomizationTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Cosmetics<c/> lets you preview and equip skins, dyes, hats, pets, particles, and titles.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>How it works:<c/>\n"
"1) Click a slot to open selection.\n"
"2) Preview changes instantly.\n"
"3) Click <c#9DFF8C>Confirm Changes<c/> to apply.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Purchases:<c/> Unowned items with prices can be bought from selection pages. Pending costs appear near Confirm.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>Consumables are consumed on confirm.\n"
"All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopCharacterTooltip.cs
msgid "(Left-click for menu)"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEmotesPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Emotes<c/> are account-wide and let you react quickly in chat and gameplay.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Flow:<c/>\n"
"1) Select an emote slot at the top.\n"
"2) Click an owned emote to assign it.\n"
"3) Click the same slot again to clear selection.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Unlocks:<c/> Purchase from the emotes shop or package offers.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesCollectPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Collect up to 3 different essences simultaneously to gain the ability to acquire those particular essences when a boss is defeated. Essences are not guranteed upon the death of a boss.\n"
"\n"
"Click an equipped essence or an empty slot to modify which one you're collecting."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesExchangePageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Exchanging an essence for one of its Unique items is as easy as collecting the specified amount and clicking the item you want.\n"
"\n"
"Essence prices that are <c#0xee3636>red<c/> indicate you do not have enough of that essence type to exchange for the item."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopEssencesMenuTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Essences serve as a [c#0xffff77]pity timer[c/], ensuring a chance for untiered items.\n"
"\n"
"By defeating enemies that Astake has uncovered the essence for, you unlock it. Start collecting that specific essence to have a chance to obtain it on boss death.\n"
"\n"
"You can collect up to 3 different essences simultaneously. Once you accumulate the required amount of essence for a specific item, you can exchange the essence for it.\n"
"\n"
"[c#ff7777]Note: Exchanging essence for an item will consume all collected essence, even if the item costs less than the total amount of that essence you have gathered.[c/]"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopGravestonesPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Graves<c/> are account-wide cosmetics for the stone left where your character falls.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Tiers:<c/> Which stone you leave depends on the silver earned before dying. A pack has one for each tier.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Use:<c/> Pick a grave to see it, and Equip puts it in its tier.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

