msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"Each tier has a weight - red 10, orange 20, green 40, blue 20, pink 10, event 5 where the item\n"
"has event affixes, HATED 10 for a HATED character spending a duplicate - and every affix of a tier\n"
"is as likely as the next. A roll scroll's affix makes the stats it lists more likely inside each tier:\n"
"+30% weight for red, rising 30% a tier to +210% for event. The Table shows every affix's chance."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/OyunsRerollingTooltip.cs
