msgid ""
"5.625 x the item's base Item Power in silver per point.\n"
"A duplicate of the item as fuel makes it free; a roll scroll takes 20% off (40% at +, 60% at ++),\n"
"and other reroll tokens do not discount it.\n"
"An item at 0 Item Power is priced as 1."
msgstr ""

