#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/LMSBehaviors.cs
msgid "So be it."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Aphrodite, my heart's delight, this place has changed- it's lost its light."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "No force in this Dominion can block my way. I'll find my love, come what may!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Love is cheesy, love is sweet, but nothing stops this heart's heartbeat!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Who are you? This isn't right! You're not my goddess, not my light!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Aphrodite should be near... Yet she is gone- she should be here!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "She haunts my thoughts, both night and day. Where has she gone? She's slipped away..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Step aside, don't block my view! I must find her, I must break through!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Aphrodite, don't conceal, don't flee. I swear, my love means you no grief."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Lost adrift in thoughts so deep- Why am I here? What secrets keep?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Perhaps I should turn and go. Was this a mistake? I just don't know..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "This force within- I feel it rise, does it bring you pain? I see it in your eyes..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Wait- come back! Don't turn away! Do you know where she's gone astray?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "You there, stop! Don't run, don't hide! Help me find my love, my guide!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "If she won't be mine, then let it be... No soul shall claim her- none but me!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Tell me true, don't speak in lies! Has love faded from her eyes?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "This cannot be how our tale must close. Not like this- not sorrow's prose!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "No! No! Fate, don't be so cruel! Please, don't let my heart be fuel..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "This is it- my path's gone wrong. Love's cruel game has played too long..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "If I can't have her, then none shall stay! We end together- no other way..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "She was the final page for me, yet love has turned to tragedy..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Get away—this cannot be! A love once pure now tortures me…"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Stay back! My heart lies torn, Shattered, lost, and left forlorn"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Let this be a dream, not real, Spare me from this pain I feel…"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Why, my love, would you betray? Why cast my heart and soul away?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your letter torn, yet here it stays- A ghost of love in tattered frays..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "No matter where or how time flies, you'll live forever in my eyes..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "What once was... is now my demise."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "hi..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "huh?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "who is there?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "what was that?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "sorry... its been a bad day"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "thadacles is back! and i think i lost something in here."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "can you help me find it?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "omg thank u!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "oh... okay.."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Love is in the air, and we're here to spread it!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Spread positivity today!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Love is in the air!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "We love you!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "We thank you for your kindness and support!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Why do you continue to vandalize this temple?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "His energy is still present... I sense it."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Why does he still toy with us from beyond this plane?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "You are but a misguided pawn from a larger game."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "By your hand I cannot fall!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your weapons lead me to believe you are hostile."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "My loyal followers will protect me..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "We are not who you should be fighting."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "I am not your usual adversary!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "How long has it been?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your disturbance will not be forgotten..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your feeble attacks only strengthen me"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "You are... a threat"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Violence remains-- the last moral of objectivity."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "This is a sacred place."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "I will liberate you from this cycle."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "Power usurped by force is not power at all."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/AsurasBehaviors.cs
msgid "I must…. Preserve… The Truth!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "The idols of information... they imprison me."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "I did not create this place, it is not mine."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "No Void should exist here, not in the presence of Null."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "The Asuras, you've met them?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "I see now, you are the exception."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "You exist beyond them, you always have."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/CatacombBehaviors.cs
msgid "What do you know of your own history?!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/DomainBehaviors.cs
msgid "You'll never get to the Void!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/DomainBehaviors.cs
msgid "Pesky humans!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/DomainBehaviors.cs
msgid "We have failed you Darza!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "These halls are hallowed, you unworthy swine!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "These fiends tread where only the worthy may stand!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "You dare profane these halls with your presence?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "May holy judgement devastate your conviction!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Look to the skies for your judgement!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Let your resolve shatter under divine judgement!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your contemptible existence disgusts me!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Make way for those with honor!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "You just delay the inevitable!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Foul heathens!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "You're nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Impossible!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Such beasts, trifling upon holy ground."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "How pathetic, the way they panic."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Know your place, your nature is impure."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Return to nothing."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Keep your distance."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Struggle is unnecessary."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Stay away, your nature is impure."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Your greed sickens me..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "It's no use."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "This won't do."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Trespassers?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "There's someone here!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Someone has entered these halls..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
msgid "Stop where you are!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/HallTwinstarBehaviors.cs
#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Intermediate/ButterflyWoodsBehaviors.cs
