#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I can be faster."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "This power is too sweet."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "You don't know speed."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I already owe this victory."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "You remind me of someone."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "You're quick, I can deal with that."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I must be even faster!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I'm... Being consumed?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I'm... Losing myself?"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I owe this to Buzz!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "I've lost too much already!"
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
msgid "This sea of blood... It's on his hands..."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/MemoryOfFleshBehaviors.cs
