#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/SacrificialSanctuaryBehaviors.cs
msgid "Anomalous being."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/SacrificialSanctuaryBehaviors.cs
msgid "Blade and boot.."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/SacrificialSanctuaryBehaviors.cs
msgid "You've met us unendable, we see you still.."
msgstr ""

#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Experienced/SacrificialSanctuaryBehaviors.cs
